  "body": "A brand-new, low-maintenance townhouse perfectly positioned in one of East Auckland's most sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nThis modern home offers:\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms + 2 bathrooms (including master ensuite)\r\n* Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n* Contemporary kitchen designed for easy everyday living\r\n* Freehold title, move-in ready\r\n* Located in the highly desirable BBI zone, this home is zoned for: Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI) Macleans Primary School Pakuranga College\r\n  \r\nPerfectly suited for:\r\n* First home buyers looking for an affordable entry into a premium suburb\r\n* Investors seeking a strong rental location with excellent school demand\r\n* Families wanting access to top-tier education\r\n\r\nVendor is highly motivated and ready to meet the market - this property MUST BE SOLD!\r\nThis is your chance to secure a quality home in a blue-chip location at an affordable level.\r\nAct fast - opportunities like this don't last long!",
